  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Unified Server Bootstrapping: Simplified Microsoft-style host builder APIs for seamless TCP and UDP transport orchestration.\n- Pluggable Security Hooks: Added support for custom UDP authentication predicates and security filtering directly during the build phase.\n- Coordinated Lifecycle: Advanced management of configuration reloads, dispatch activation, and listener startup for robust service availability.\n- Dependency-Injection Integration: Streamlined registration of core network services into the standard Nalix InstanceManager.",
